<title>USA: Savage, Minn., $2 mln, won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>Savage, Minn., $2 mln, won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc., said it won $2.705 million of Savage, Minn., general obligation tax increment bonds, series 1997B, with a true interest cost of 5.16 percent.</p>
</text>
